  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "kGMnAEQi+dNCzOKXC/JjvVpFmD4=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:43:30.495Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "`@powerhousedao/registry` is a Verdaccio-based registry that is also a **CDN for package bundles (ESM)**, so a browser or Node process can `import()` a package's built files directly.\n\nThe package API is three endpoints \u2014 `GET /packages` (all discovered packages, filterable with `?documentType=`), `GET /packages/by-document-type?type=\u2026` (package names providing a document type), and `GET /packages/<packageName>` (one package, scoped names supported).\n\nThe CDN endpoint is `GET /-/cdn/<packageName>/<filePath>`. On first request it **fetches and extracts the tarball** from Verdaccio, looking for files in the package root and then `cdn/`, `dist/cdn/` and `dist/`. If the package is not published locally, **Verdaccio transparently proxies** metadata and tarballs from the configured upstream (`--uplink`, default `https://registry.npmjs.org/`), and the CDN extracts that upstream tarball into `cdn-cache/<pkg>/<version>/` exactly as it does a local one \u2014 including for `@powerhousedao/*` packages, where the registry prefers its local copy and falls back upstream.\n\nCaching is keyed on the **shape of the request**, which is the part worth remembering: a version-pinned request (`<pkg>@1.2.3/\u2026`) gets `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable`, while a moving request (a dist-tag like `@dev` or `@latest`, or untagged) gets `public, max-age=60, must-revalidate`. A version-derived weak `ETag` is sent and a matching `If-None-Match` returns `304`. And when the **upstream metadata lookup fails** \u2014 as distinct from a genuine not-found \u2014 the endpoint serves the latest cached version if it has one and otherwise answers `503` rather than a cacheable `404`, so a transient upstream outage cannot poison a cache with a negative result.\n\n## Provenance\n- `packages/registry/README.md` \u2014 intro; API \u203a Packages; CDN (proxying, cache headers, upstream failure)\n\n_Extracted from the Powerhouse repository at **v6.2.2-dev.74**._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-03T07:43:30.495Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:43:30.495Z"
    }
  },
